flowchart TD
    Start([Uninstall；不构造 Cloud/Catalog Manager]) --> Lock[Acquire apm.lock]
    Lock --> Recover[Recover shared journal；零 catalog/content 调用]
    Recover --> Refresh[RefreshInstalled]
    Refresh --> Manifest[Config List + manifest-first 本地解析]
    Manifest -->|无记录| WarnNone[Warn + Agent-only unexecuted]
    Manifest -->|有记录| Type{Power type}

    Type -->|Skill| Skill[ResolveSkill + filesystem Uninstall]
    Type -->|Agent| AgentPower[ResolveAgent + filesystem UninstallAgent]
    Skill --> FSJournal[schema v1 filesystem journal]
    AgentPower --> FSJournal

    Type -->|MCP| MCP[ResolveMCP + Agent CLI Inspect]
    MCP -->|absent| MCPMissing[只删除对应 manifest 项；不创建 journal]
    MCP -->|present| MCPRemove[创建 definition-free agent-cli journal；按 Ref/name Remove]
    MCPRemove --> MCPCommit[持久化 committing；删除 manifest 与 journal]
    MCPCommit -. 崩溃后 Fix .-> MCPRecover[再次 Inspect；present 继续 Remove，absent 提交清单删除；永不 Add]

    Type -->|Plugin| Plugin[ResolvePlugin + 本地 Agent facts]
    Plugin -->|Codex / Claude exact present| Lookup[只读 Lookup manifest 精确 artifact；验证 source/selector]
    Lookup --> PluginTx[离线 UninstallPlugin；保留 marketplace 与 artifact]
    Plugin -->|Hermes / Bibit exact present| FilesystemPlugin[离线 filesystem UninstallPlugin]
    Plugin -->|target absent| PluginMissing[只删除对应 manifest 项]
    Plugin -->|部分、损坏或冲突| Fail[fail closed；保留 manifest/artifact/journal]

    FSJournal --> Result{TargetMissing 或 error?}
    MCPMissing --> Result
    MCPCommit --> Result
    PluginTx --> Result
    FilesystemPlugin --> Result
    PluginMissing --> Result
    Result -->|missing| WarnMissing[lock-held target-missing Warn]
    Result -->|error| Fail
    Result -->|success| Done[full-ref completed]
    WarnMissing --> Done
    WarnNone --> Next{下一个 Agent?}
    Done --> Next
    Next -->|是| Manifest
    Next -->|否| Release[Release 后渲染]
    Fail --> Batch[当前 failed；剩余 unexecuted] --> Release
